title: DBX Tenant Memory Platform
summary: Isolated tenant memory on EKS

group "DBX Clients and Interfaces" [color: blue] {
  Python SDK [icon: server]
  LangChain RAG Example [icon: server]
  LlamaIndex RAG Example [icon: server]
  NextJS Cache Example [icon: server]
  DBX Operator Dashboard [icon: server]
  Public Website [icon: internet]
}

group "GitHub Repository Delivery" [color: orange] {
  GitHub Actions Build and Test [icon: server]
  GitHub Actions Docker Publish [icon: server]
  GitHub Actions Pages Deploy [icon: server]
  GHCR DBX Orchestrator Image [icon: containerd]
  GitHub Pages Website [icon: internet]
}

group "AWS us-east-1" [color: green] {
  DBX Orchestrator S3 IAM Role [icon: iam]
  DBX Backups S3 Bucket [icon: s3]

  group "DBX Global Cluster VPC" [color: green] {
    DBX Global EKS Cluster [icon: eks]
    EKS Orchestrator Node Group [icon: ec2]
    EKS Data Plane Node Group [icon: ec2]

    group "DBX Kubernetes Workload" [color: purple] {
      DBX Public LoadBalancer Service [icon: load-balancer]
      DBX Internal Headless Service [icon: load-balancer]
      DBX Orchestrator StatefulSet [icon: server]
      DBX Orchestrator Service Account [icon: iam]
      DBX Control Plane Secret [icon: secrets-manager]
      DBX TLS Secret [icon: secrets-manager]
      DBX Persistent Volume Claim [icon: database]
      DBX Orchestrator [icon: server]
      Embedded Dashboard Bundle [icon: server]
      Tenant DBX Server Process [icon: server]
      Tenant KV and Vector Engine [icon: dynamodb]
      Tenant Data Volume [icon: database]
    }
  }
}

Python SDK > DBX Public LoadBalancer Service [conduit: HTTP:8000 and RESP:6380]
LangChain RAG Example > DBX Public LoadBalancer Service [conduit: HTTP:8000 and RESP:6380]
LlamaIndex RAG Example > DBX Public LoadBalancer Service [conduit: HTTP:8000 and RESP:6380]
NextJS Cache Example > DBX Public LoadBalancer Service [conduit: RESP:6380]
DBX Operator Dashboard > DBX Public LoadBalancer Service [conduit: HTTP:8000]
Public Website > GitHub Pages Website [conduit: HTTPS]
GitHub Actions Build and Test > DBX Operator Dashboard [conduit: npm build]
GitHub Actions Build and Test > DBX Orchestrator [conduit: Go build]
GitHub Actions Docker Publish > GHCR DBX Orchestrator Image [conduit: Docker registry push]
GitHub Actions Pages Deploy > GitHub Pages Website [conduit: GitHub Pages deployment]
GHCR DBX Orchestrator Image > DBX Orchestrator StatefulSet [conduit: container image pull]

DBX Global EKS Cluster > EKS Orchestrator Node Group [conduit: Kubernetes scheduling]
DBX Global EKS Cluster > EKS Data Plane Node Group [conduit: Kubernetes scheduling]
EKS Orchestrator Node Group > DBX Orchestrator StatefulSet [conduit: Kubernetes scheduling]
EKS Data Plane Node Group > Tenant DBX Server Process [conduit: Kubernetes scheduling]

DBX Public LoadBalancer Service > DBX Orchestrator StatefulSet [conduit: HTTP:8000 and RESP:6380]
DBX Internal Headless Service > DBX Orchestrator StatefulSet [conduit: HTTP:8000]
DBX Orchestrator Service Account > DBX Orchestrator StatefulSet [conduit: Kubernetes service account]
DBX Orchestrator StatefulSet > DBX Orchestrator [conduit: container process]
DBX Control Plane Secret > DBX Orchestrator [conduit: environment variables]
DBX TLS Secret > DBX Orchestrator [conduit: mounted certificate volume]
DBX Persistent Volume Claim > Tenant Data Volume [conduit: persistent storage]
DBX Orchestrator > Embedded Dashboard Bundle [conduit: Go embed]
DBX Orchestrator > Tenant DBX Server Process [conduit: isolated process and RESP proxy]
DBX Orchestrator > Tenant Data Volume [conduit: tenant state files]
Tenant DBX Server Process > Tenant KV and Vector Engine [conduit: internal]
Tenant KV and Vector Engine > Tenant Data Volume [conduit: WAL and checkpoints]
DBX Orchestrator > DBX Orchestrator S3 IAM Role [conduit: IAM web identity]
DBX Orchestrator S3 IAM Role > DBX Backups S3 Bucket [conduit: S3 API]